# Domains the stagr setup VM may always reach through the egress proxy
# (DP-456). Each line admits the domain and its subdomains. Installed at
# /etc/egress/default.list in CT110; run `egress-ctl refresh` after editing.
# Anything else needs an approved request_web_access grant.
github.com
githubusercontent.com
pypi.org
pythonhosted.org
# Debian packages, so the setup agent can apt install on its own box.
deb.debian.org
security.debian.org
